  "description": "OpenVINO C# API 3.3.1 provides managed .NET wrappers aligned with the OpenVINO 2026.3 C API and optional OpenVINO GenAI C API. It keeps the published core API compatible, adds C# friendly helpers, supports .NET Framework 4.6-4.8 and .NET 5-10, and works with separate cross-platform native runtime NuGet packages.",
